OL,3,A'It can kill us': Kenyans fear impact
OL,4,Aof El Nino with floods predicted
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It flooded up to here in March," Agnes
OL,7,FShikoli says, pointing to a spot
OL,8,Fhalfway up the six-foot [1.8m]
OL,9,Fcorrugated iron wall of her home in
OL,10,FKibera, one of the largest informal
OL,11,Fsettlements in Kenya.
OL,13,FHer tiny house lies just a couple of
OL,14,Fmetres from the Ngong river, which runs
OL,15,Fthrough this densely populated area in
OL,16,Fthe capital, Nairobi.
OL,18,FThe scars of floods in the long rainy
OL,19,Fseason earlier this year can still be
OL,20,Fseen - including a broken TV in the
OL,21,Fcorner which was immersed in water.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
