OL,3,AHeadquarters of Haitian gang destroyed,
OL,4,AEl Salvador's president says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is El Salvador's first military
OL,7,Faction on a Haitian target since it
OL,8,Fdeployed more than 2,000 soldiers there
OL,9,Flast month, as part of a mission to
OL,10,Frescue four missing Salvadoran
OL,11,Ftechnicians.
OL,13,FHaiti has been plagued by gang violence
OL,14,Ffor years, with heavily armed groups
OL,15,Fcontrolling large parts of the capital,
OL,16,Fand beyond.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
